Z||000000||87ECO5||04-19-2000||03:24 PM||||I purchased a set for my father for his Porsche 911 and they looked really good.  They were made in the same black vinyl material with the white cotton backing and had an elastic opening that snugged up against the arm that connects the mirror housing to the door.  Plus, they had the Porsche emblem burned in.<P>Just wondering if anyone made/makes some for the Fiero.||||reg||5
